                                                "sense_id": "404c714e-9e38-3081-b4d1-96e7bfee939c",
                                                "text": "[Of a Persian wine] One name for this wine was 黑水晶 \"black crystal\"; it has also been confused with koumiss."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a354e8fc-5421-4119-9026-343661c990e2",
                                                "sense_id": "404c714e-9e38-3081-b4d1-96e7bfee939c",
                                                "text": "Here, for example—a Scythian koumiss vessel, third century B.C. You can clearly see the Greek influence, especially in the friezework."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
